        <section class="content">
                <div class="offer">
                    <div class="container">
                                </div>
                </div>
    	                                <p>Az olasz kiejt&eacute;s n&eacute;ha pofonegyszerű, n&eacute;ha viszont kifog az &aacute;tlag magyar vend&eacute;gen az &eacute;ttermekben.</p>
<div class="offer">
    <div class="container">
	<div id="microsite_microsite" class="miniapp microsite">
	    <div id='adoceanindexhuqpdghpluio' data-id='adoceanindexhuqpdghpluio' class='iap iap--ado roadblock'>
                                                        <script class='iap-script'>
                                                            window.iap_zones = window.iap_zones || [];
                                                            window.iap_zones.push({"id":"adoceanindexhuqpdghpluio","empty":true,"lazy":false,"quality":true,"masterless":false,"area":"Welovebudapest_Aloldal_RB_A","events":{"loaded":false,"visible":false,"viewed":false},"stat":{"site":"welovebudapest","path":"cikk/","type":"cikk"}});
                                                        </script>
                                                    </div>
	    	</div>
    </div>
</div>
                            <p>A leggyakrabban helytelen&uuml;l ismert, mondott <strong>olasz hozz&aacute;val&oacute;k, illetve fog&aacute;sok</strong>&nbsp;kiejt&eacute;s&eacute;ről k&eacute;rdez&uuml;nk titeket ebben a kv&iacute;z&uuml;nkben.</p>
